  "content": "[Intro]\n[A]  [C#m]\n[A]  [C#m]\n[D#m]\n[A]  [C#m]\n[A]  [C#m]\n[D#m]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Dm]Lift you\nup again\nGive you to the trees\n[E]\n[Dm]All sound and\nvisions are\nWhat they ask of me\n[E]\n[Dm]Let's run fast\nthrough the fields\nOver mountaintops\n[E]\n[Dm]Let's swim through\nocean water\nAnd we'll never stop\n[E]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Dm]Just\n[F]close [A#]your\n[A/E]eyes\n[Dm]And pre-\ntend that [D#]everything's\n[A/E]fi-\nne\n[Dm]Just\n[F]close [A#]your\n[A/E]eyes\n[Csus2]I'll\ntell you [D#5]when\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Dm]Can you\nshow me\nWhere to find the stream\n[E]\n[Dm]I've been\ntold before\nThat the water's clean\n[E]\n[Dm]Will you\ncome with me\nTwo of us can drink\n[E]\n[Dm]Move quick we've\ngot to hurry\nThere's no time to think\n[E]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Dm]Just\n[F]close [A#]your\n[A/E]eyes\n[Dm]And pre-\ntend that [D#]everything's\n[A/E]fi-\nne\n[Dm]Just\n[F]close [A#]your\n[A/E]eyes\n[Csus2]I'll\ntell you [D#5]when\n\n[Interlude]\n[A]  [C#m]\n[A]  [C#m]\n[D#m]\n[A]  [C#m]\n[A]  [E5]\n\n[Break]\n[D#5]\n[Am]\n[D]\n[Am]\n[Csus2]\n[Am]\n[Csus2]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Dm]We didn't\n[C#5]come this far\n[Dm]Just to\n[C#5]turn around\n[Dm]We didn't\n[C#5]come this far\n[Dm]Just to\n[C#5]run away\n[G]Just ahead\n[F#m]\n[G]We will hear the sound\n[F#m]\n[G]The sound that\n[F#m]gives us\n[G]A brand new\n[F#m]day\n\n[Bridge]\n[Am]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Dm]Just\n[F]close [A#]your\n[A/E]eyes\n[Dm]And pre-\ntend that [D#]everything's\n[A/E]fi-\nne\n[Dm]Just\n[F]close [A#]your\n[A/E]eyes\n[Csus2]I'll\ntell you [D#5]when\n\n[Outro]\n[A]  [C#m]\n[A]  [C#m]\n[D#m]\n[A]  [C#m]\n[A]  [C#m]\n[D#m]\n[A]  [C#m]\n[A]  [C#m]\n[D#m]\n[A]  [C#m]\n[A]  [C#m]\n[D#m]\n[A]",
